35-Status on board: pending
36-
37-New task, separate from TASK-THYROX-0601 and not part of the pool lifecycle. No technical dependency on the periodic-snapshot task: it needs a valid <n>.closed, a valid generation and a stable final result.
38-
39-Flow: <n>.closed → DocumentationPublisher → kaupamex-docs. Verifies CLOSED and generation; resolves the consumer; reads a DocumentIntent produced by the item (consumer, initiative, document_kind, target under pm/<root>/iniciativas/<slug>/, expected_blob, source_run, source_item, source_generation, source_snapshot); takes a lock on the target file; creates a temporary kaupamex-docs worktree; checks the expected blob; writes the RST; runs the existing gates; makes its own commit; publishes its result.
